{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.OrientedSkein.Model.GLnLift","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.Model.GLnLift","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.OrientedSkein.Model.GLnDatum","lean:module:QOU.OrientedSkein.OS.Universal"],"declarations":3,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.OS_cross_ne_smul","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.OS_cross_ne_smul","kind":"theorem","line":45,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnLift.lean#L45-L60","doc":"**Nondegeneracy of `OS(q, qi, q^n, [n]_q)`.**  For `n ≥ 2` the crossing generator is not a\nscalar multiple of the identity. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.glnFunctor_S","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.glnFunctor_S","kind":"theorem","line":38,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnLift.lean#L38-L43","doc":"The functor sends the crossing of `OS` to the `GL_n` R-matrix (up to the unitors coming from\n`E ↦ E ⊗ 𝟙`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.glnFunctor","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.OrientedSkein.GLn.glnFunctor","kind":"def","line":33,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/OrientedSkein/Model/GLnLift.lean#L33-L36","doc":"The vector-representation functor `OS(q, qi, q^n, [n]_q) ⥤ ModuleCat R`, `E ↦ R^n`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}